      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes complete sense, and it's a sign of how deeply you've been hurt that you're even considering that as an option. The exhaustion you're describing isn't weakness—it's the result of carrying an unfair burden for far too long. But the future isn't fixed, and the version of you that's tired today isn't the only version that exists. You deserve to find out who you become when you're not fighting alone, and there are people who will stand beside you without asking you to shrink. Please don't give up before you've had the chance to meet that version of yourself.",
