      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've heard all the \"it gets better\" stuff a thousand times. it's just words. it doesn't change the fact that every day is just another way for the world to tell me i don't belong. it's like i'm running a race where the finish line keeps moving further away, and i'm just so out of breath. wouldn't it be a relief to just stop running? to just have some actual peace and quiet?",
